---
import { List, Code, Codeblock } from "@teseor/react";
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="List — Teseor">
  <main class="t-stack" data-gap="6">
    <h1>List</h1>
    <p>Ordered / unordered list primitive. Renders `&lt;ul&gt;` or `&lt;ol&gt;` based on `ordered`; styles bare `&lt;li&gt;` children with grid-rhythm spacing and prose-friendly markers.</p>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Examples</h2>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>default</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <List>List</List>
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;List&gt;List&lt;/List&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>ordered</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <List ordered="true">List</List>
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;List ordered="true"&gt;List&lt;/List&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>compact</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <List spacing="compact">List</List>
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;List spacing="compact"&gt;List&lt;/List&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
      <div class="t-stack" data-gap="2">
        <h3>comfortable</h3>
        <div class="t-cluster" data-gap="3">
          <List spacing="comfortable">List</List>
        </div>
        <Codeblock>&lt;List spacing="comfortable"&gt;List&lt;/List&gt;</Codeblock>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Props</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Responsive</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>ordered</Code></td><td><Code>string</Code></td><td></td><td><Code>false</Code></td><td>Switches the rendered tag between `&lt;ul&gt;` (`false`) and `&lt;ol&gt;` (`true`). String-typed because `elementByProp` v1 accepts string-valued controlling props only. Renders as <Code>&lt;ul&gt;</Code> for <Code>false</Code>, <Code>&lt;ol&gt;</Code> for <Code>true</Code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>spacing</Code></td><td><Code>string</Code></td><td>✓</td><td><Code>comfortable</Code></td><td>Vertical rhythm between list items. `comfortable` matches prose defaults; `compact` suits dense in-app surfaces (nav rails, comment threads).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>asChild</Code></td><td><Code>boolean</Code></td><td></td><td><Code>false</Code></td><td>Render the trigger directly on the consumer's child element (cloneElement) instead of wrapping in a &lt;span&gt;. Single-child invariant; the child receives the wrapper's &lt;code&gt;style&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;data-state&lt;/code&gt;, event handlers, and any ARIA attributes the component applies (component-specific). Not compatible with Astro slots — use the default wrapper there.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Tokens</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Fallback</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-list-marker-color</Code></td><td><Code>--t-on-surface-muted</Code></td><td>Color of the list marker (bullet or numeral).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-list-spacing-item</Code></td><td><Code>--t-space-2</Code></td><td>Vertical gap between adjacent `&lt;li&gt;` children. Snapped to the grid-rhythm scale.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-list-spacing-block</Code></td><td><Code>--t-space-4</Code></td><td>Vertical rhythm above and below the list in prose context.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-list-indent</Code></td><td><Code>--t-space-5</Code></td><td>Inline padding reserved for the marker glyph.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Forced colors</h2>
      <p>In Windows High Contrast mode, the component remaps these semantic tokens to CSS system colors. Custom-property inheritance carries the values to every reference in the subtree.</p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Default</th><th>Forced-colors</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><Code>--t-on-surface-muted</Code></td><td><Code>oklch(from oklch(from oklch(58% 0.2 268deg) 50% calc(c * 0.025) h) 18% c h)</Code></td><td><Code>CanvasText</Code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <section class="t-stack" data-gap="3">
      <h2>Bundle size</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Artifact</th><th>Raw</th><th>Gzip</th><th>Brotli</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href="https://github.com/teseor/teseor/blob/main/packages/css/src/components/list/list.css"><Code>@teseor/css/components/list.css</Code></a></td><td>1.92 KB</td><td>0.54 KB</td><td>0.47 KB</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
